<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<Defs>

  <!-- Put a car on the ground.

       targetRequired false and a self-cast: the car is assembled just in front of the caster, so there is nothing to aim. Where it goes afterwards is the drive's problem.

       Deploying takes no control and pins nobody. That separation is the point of the item -
       a car parked in a corridor before the raid arrives costs nothing until somebody picks up
       the handset.

       displayGizmoWhileUndrafted is true, like the stasis belt: placing a car is preparation,
       and preparation that can only be done while drafted is preparation done too late.

       casterMustBeCapableOfViolence is true. The car is a bomb, and a pacifist does not get to
       drive one on the technicality that the button is somewhere else. -->
  <AbilityDef>
    <defName>AG_DeployToyCar</defName>
    <label>deploy toy car</label>
    <description>Assemble and place a remote demolition drone just in front of you.\n\nThe drone does nothing until somebody takes control of it. Controlling it costs the operator everything else: while driving they cannot move, shoot or work. It can be detonated on command, and detonates by itself if the operator is downed or killed while driving.</description>
    <iconPath>RimArt/ToyCar/IconDeploy</iconPath>
    <category>AG_Genetic</category>
    <cooldownTicksRange>15000</cooldownTicksRange>
    <jobDef>AG_CastAbilityOnThingWithoutWeapon</jobDef>
    <targetRequired>false</targetRequired>
    <hostile>false</hostile>
    <aiCanUse>false</aiCanUse>
    <casterMustBeCapableOfViolence>true</casterMustBeCapableOfViolence>
    <displayGizmoWhileUndrafted>true</displayGizmoWhileUndrafted>
    <disableGizmoWhileUndrafted>false</disableGizmoWhileUndrafted>
    <sendMessageOnCooldownComplete>true</sendMessageOnCooldownComplete>
    <verbProperties>
      <verbClass>Verb_CastAbility</verbClass>
      <range>-1</range>
      <warmupTime>0.8</warmupTime>
      <drawAimPie>false</drawAimPie>
      <requireLineOfSight>false</requireLineOfSight>
      <targetParams>
        <canTargetSelf>true</canTargetSelf>
      </targetParams>
    </verbProperties>
    <comps>
      <li Class="RimArt.CompProperties_AbilityDeployToyCar" />
    </comps>
  </AbilityDef>

</Defs>
